{"id":"1b55a40958811c5e","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-delta-k-p.md","title":"Delta Levels of PH","display":"df-delta-k-p — Delta Levels of PH","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-delta-k-p","aliases":["28-df-delta-k-p","Delta-k-P"],"display":"df-delta-k-p — Delta Levels of PH","depends_on":["[[28-df-p]]","[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","[[28-df-oracle-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-delta-k-p"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-delta-k-p</span><span>Delta-k-P</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-delta-k-p — Delta Levels of PH"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e4f9f10bc85fd486\" href=\"?note=e4f9f10bc85fd486\" title=\"28-df-sigma-k-p\">28-df-sigma-k-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" href=\"?note=f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" title=\"28-df-oracle-class\">28-df-oracle-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{k-1}^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\Sigma_{k-1}^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 与类预言机指数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P^{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathbf P^{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e4f9f10bc85fd486\" href=\"?note=e4f9f10bc85fd486\" title=\"28-df-sigma-k-p\">28-df-sigma-k-p</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" href=\"?note=f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" title=\"28-df-oracle-class\">28-df-oracle-class</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^{\\mathbf P}\\coloneqq\\mathbf P,\\qquad\n\\Delta_k^{\\mathbf P}\\coloneqq\\mathbf P^{\\Sigma_{k-1}^{\\mathbf P}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_0^{\\mathbf P}\\coloneqq\\mathbf P,\\qquad\n\\Delta_k^{\\mathbf P}\\coloneqq\\mathbf P^{\\Sigma_{k-1}^{\\mathbf P}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>据此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_1^{\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf P\">\\(\\Delta_1^{\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf P\\)</span>。类指数有显式并类定义，不再只在 Remark 中依赖“选一完全语言”的说明。本书§5.5使用语言预言机刻画 PH；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 记号是本目录补充的标准记号约定。</p>\n<p>来源核对：参照§5.5；印刷102–103页；PDF128–129页。预言机层级接口已核对；Delta记号为本地补充。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sigma-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"e4f9f10bc85fd486","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-oracle-class","status":"resolved","id":"f4ae5e0b4d42d561","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-oracle-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d4